            "heading": "About 30 minutes",
            "text": "<p>Twenty minutes of shucking and dicing, then ten in the fridge while the flavors come together.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "g_serves": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "users",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "Serves 4",
            "text": "<p>As an appetizer, from one bag of our Half-Shell Scallops. Spoon it back into the prettiest shells to serve.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "g_rice": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "heart",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "No cooking",
            "text": "<p>A sharp knife, a cutting board and a bowl. The only heat is boiling water to wash the shells.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
