        "description": "<p>One bag of our Half-Shell Scallops is the only thing from the freezer, and the shells become the serving dish. Shell-off Scallops work too: serve it in a bowl. The rest is Fuyu persimmons, passion fruit, a lime, yuzu juice, a Fresno pepper, a red onion, Vera Salt and Urfa pepper, with tortilla chips if you like.</p>",
