        },
        "f_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Each bag holds 16 oz of Peruvian scallops on the half shell, shucked and individually snap-frozen. They are raised in Sechura Bay, Peru, in traditional hanging lantern baskets.</p><p>Our Half-Shell Scallops tested at about 8 g protein and 7 mcg selenium per 2 oz serving. Values vary by sample and season.</p><p>Low mercury, tested to a tenth of the FDA action level. Every supplier is third-party tested for nutrition, mercury and microplastics, then randomly audited to ensure consistent compliance with the Seatopia Standard. Farms named, panels published.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
